<title>USA: EPA to seek more data on BP Toledo upgrades.</title>
<headline>EPA to seek more data on BP Toledo upgrades.</headline>
<byline>Matt Daily</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Enviromental Protection Agency will seek additional information from British Petroluem on information on the impact of the proposed upgrades to its Toledo, Ohio refinery.</p>
<p>A letter from the federal agency's regional office in Chicago to the Ohio branch called BP's proposal inadequate since it did not fully address the environmental impact of the refinery's move to boost heavy sour crude runs to 80 percent from less than 20 percent currently.</p>
</text>
